  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feminist Football Club &quot;La Nuestra&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feminist Football Club &quot;La Nuestra&quot; aims to guarantee an owned space for women and people from the LGBTIQ collective in sports and culture.  La Nuestra maintains its practice dedicated to football played by women and diversities in Villa 31, Buenos Aires, Argentina. The practice links training days with group spaces where sport becomes an area of containment, reflection and expression for those who participate.</narrative>
  </description>
